      learn: `<div class="section-title">Semi-Supervised Learning</div>
<p class="theory-text">Semi-supervised learning trains with a <strong>small labelled set</strong> + a <strong>large unlabelled set</strong>. The unlabelled data reveals the data distribution and improves decision boundaries.</p>
<div class="code-block"><span class="cc"># Common approaches</span>
- Self-training: label unlabelled samples with current model, retrain
