  2. Policy Improvement: π'(s) = argmaxₐ [R+γV^π(s')]
until π doesn't change

<span class="cc"># Value Iteration (combines both steps)</span>
V(s) ← maxₐ [R(s,a) + γ Σₛ' P(s'|s,a) V(s')]  # repeat until convergence
π*(s) = argmaxₐ [R(s,a) + γ Σₛ' P(s'|s,a) V*(s')]</div>
<div class="callout info">Monte Carlo policy evaluation uses sampled episodes to estimate V^π — no model of P required.</div>`,
